# Whirlwind of Thought: "An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to
# trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered" (ruling 2020-04-17). Bot2's Counterspell counters Bot1's Lotus Petal
# on turn 3, the Petal goes to the graveyard, and Bot1 still draws its card: hand 2 + the turn-3 draw - 1 cast + 1 = 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Whirlwind of Thought
Mox Jet
Lotus Petal
Island
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Counterspell
Mox Sapphire
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Whirlwind of Thought.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Stack.Lotus Petal)

